      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160746\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160746\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Where applicable to the proposed work, the statement shall identify:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160747\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160747\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;1.&#160;&#160;&#160;The occupancy group or groups that apply to parts of the building in accordance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-165864', hash: '#JD_BC302' }}\">302<\/Link> of the <span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">New York City Building Code;<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160748\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160748\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;The occupancy group of the main use or dominant occupancy of the building;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160749\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160749\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;3.&#160;&#160;&#160;The construction type of the building in accordance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-168832', hash: '#JD_BC602' }}\">602<\/Link> of the <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">New York City Building Code<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">;<\/span><\/div